<h2>Reset Password Request</h2>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for your account on the <strong>{{appName}}</strong> portal.</p>
<p>Click the button below to configure a new password:</p>
<div align="center">
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="btn">Configure New Password</a>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">If you did not request this, you can ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.</p>
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">This reset link will expire in 60 minutes.</p>
